      "content": "Respect filesystem tool path constraints. If a tool requires source/destination to be local names, treat '..' as a literal name, not a path. Before moving between sibling directories, confirm the tool supports such moves; if not, use a staged approach (e.g., ensure source is in destination) and verify state after each step to avoid misnamed entries.",
      "sources": ["multi_turn_base_10"]
    },
    {
      "content": "When a write command fails with 'No such file', create the target file first (e.g., with touch) in the current directory, then re-issue the write. Always confirm the file appears in the directory listing before proceeding to content-write or comparison steps.",
      "sources": ["multi_turn_base_10"]
    },
    {
      "content": "Cross-validate comparison tools (e.g., diff) by reading both files' actual contents when results seem inconsistent with known state. Comparison tools may return empty output due to quirks even when files genuinely differ; use direct reads to ensure accurate conclusions before reporting.",
      "sources": ["multi_turn_base_10"]
    }
  ]
}
